      "content": "it's more than just 'efficiency' though, right? when u look at the actual math behind the angles, they aren't just random. they seem to correspond to specific coordinates or even certain frequencies. if these companies are controlling the primary supply chains for the entire planet, wouldn't it make sense for them to use their visual identity to broadcast subtle, subconscious cues to the public to prepare us for whatever shift is coming? like, if you were trying to signal a massive geopolitical reorganization without causing panic, how would you use design to do it?",
